# A @display key that names no token (a misspelling) is an error, not ignored.
# error: display_unknown_token.grammar:16:5:
# error: @display names IDENTT, which is no token
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    newline
    eof
    err
'\n'                                        → newline
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
@display
    IDENTT: "a name"
top! = IDENT                                → (t 1)
